  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      361.08,
      286.45,
      452.48
    ],
    "text": "Notice under Section 7 I, hereby give notice, under sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as Amended by the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intends to acquire the following land/servitude* which is required for a public purpose.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      452.71,
      276.12,
      469.75
    ],
    "text": "Description of the land or servitude to be acquired :",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.9994001388549805,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      471.2,
      286.37,
      688.16
    ],
    "text": "1. District :- Mullaitivu 2. Divisional Secretariat:-Maritimepattu 3. Name of land :- Puliyadiyil Kadu 4. Land Owner Name :-1. Mrs. Vasanthakumari Ganeshan, 2. Mr. Kumariya Mahenthiran 3. Mrs. Santhirakumari Kanthasamy 5. G. N. Division :- Kumarapuram Mul/118 6. Village :- Kumarapuram 7. Preliminary Plan No. :- \u023f. 181 8. Lot No. :- 01-04 9. Extent:- 7.4932 Hectares 10. Land Bounders :- North :- Road East :- Thamotharampillai Nadarasapillai South :- TP 226583 West :- Kumariya Vijayakumari",
    "fonts": [
      "IskoolaPota",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      349.76,
      539.39,
      486.8
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land/lands* on which a servitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at Divisional Secretary, Maritimepattu Mullaitivu on the 31st day of July 2018 at 10.00 a.m. and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 26th day of July 2018 the nature of their interests in the land. The particulars of their claims for Compensation for the acquisition of the said land/servitude the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
